  "question": {
    "text": "The compressibility factor $(Z)$ of one mole of a van der Waals' gas of negligible ' $a$ ' value is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "DFqNB",
      "text": "1",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "u3HB3",
      "text": "$\\frac{b p}{R T}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b6Lbn",
      "text": "$1+\\frac{b p}{R T}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9rrhq",
      "text": "$1-\\frac{b p}{R T}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "van der Waals' equation is $\\left(p+\\frac{a}{V^{2}}\\right)(V-b)=R T$\r\n(for 1 mole)\r\nIf $a$ is negligible, $p+\\frac{a}{V^{2}} \\approx p$\r\n$$\r\np(V-b)=R T \\Rightarrow p V-p b=R T\r\n$$\r\nor $\\frac{p V}{R T}-\\frac{p b}{R T}=1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{p V}{R T}=1+\\frac{p b}{R T}$",
    "image": null
  },
